<section begin=intro />
'''Tactical Reload''' is an [[:Category:Exilus Weapon Mods|Exilus Weapon Mod]] for [[:Category:Assault Rifle Mods|rifles]] usable in both PvE and [[Conclave]] that [[reload]]s a portion of a rifle's [[Ammo|magazine]] for each second it is holstered.
<section end=intro />

==Stats==
{| class="emodtable"
